    <summary>An Azure Functions extension for Visual Studio Code.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[**This package is deprecated.** It duplicates the [vscode-azurefunctions](https://community.chocolatey.org/packages/vscode-azurefunctions) package, which installs the same Azure Functions extension for Visual Studio Code.

This version installs nothing itself. It depends on vscode-azurefunctions, so upgrading this package moves you to that package. Use vscode-azurefunctions directly for new installs.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>Deprecated in favour of the vscode-azurefunctions package.</releaseNotes>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="vscode-azurefunctions" version="1.22.0" />
